  "notes": "Release date from the launch blog post (Mar 11, 2024); the docs changelog entry is dated 2024-03-24 (alternative). The Hugging Face repository was created on 2024-03-11. The API id became command-r-03-2024 when the August 2024 update arrived; the alias command-r points to it. Lifecycle follows the deprecations page; the weights stay downloadable on Hugging Face. The deprecation notice recommends command-r-08-2024, command-r-plus-08-2024 or command-a-03-2025 without pairing them, so replacedBy is left out. Context window 128,000 tokens per the docs page."
